@copilot Update this PR directly with one scoped correction from its completed Copilot review. Remove the changes to docs/instrumentation-list.yaml from the PR, restoring that generated file to the PR base version. Keep the GradleParser coordinate interpolation, its regression test, and the Play Scala 3 Muzzle range [3.0.0,) unchanged.

The verified review finding is https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/21105#discussion_r4432848884. .github/instructions/instrumentation-list.instructions.md explicitly says not to edit docs/instrumentation-list.yaml; .github/workflows/metadata-update.yml generates it nightly. This corrects the initial assignment's request to include generated output: the source fixes should supply the corrected coordinates to that existing workflow instead.

