Do not edit docs/instrumentation-list.yaml or the metadata workflow; the existing nightly workflow owns the generated catalog. Keep the work in this same PR, with no unrelated changes to Payara, Log4j, or other instrumentation. Run the narrow existing parser validation and affected Muzzle validation appropriate to this change. Acceptance requires the live PR's Scala 3 range and regression expectation to use (,), with assertInverse preserved and the existing interpolation fix intact.

